WEBVTT

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:13.180
A concert at Higako?!

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.433
You're seriously thinking that?
Would anyone come?

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:20.312
I've actually been thinking
about it for a while now.

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:24.066
Our neighbors here support us all the time,

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:26.902
so I wanted to give back by hosting an event!

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:27.945
Ino...

00:00:27.945 --> 00:00:29.238
Ino...

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:30.239
Inocchi...

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:31.949
Ino-<i>sempai</i>...

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.871
Are you sure about this wholesome idea?

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.415
I can be wholesome at times, too!

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:44.628
But where? Did Higako have a good place...?

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:46.296
I'm not sure.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:48.590
What do you think, Hoho?

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.716
"Grumble, grumble"
Not bad...

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.052
"Grumble, grumble"
--My money radar is reacting a lot.
--Hoho?

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:55.472
"Grumble, grumble"
A large-scale event, taking advantage
of Ino's local popularity...

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:59.476
"Grumble, grumble"
Create a festival-esque event
where stalls make bank...

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:03.021
Um... Hey.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.483
Give me a minute! I'm doing my calculations now.

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:11.405
I doubt a wholesome part of Hoho exists.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.250
"Dropout Graduation?"

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.794
"Dropout Graduation?"
Dropout Graduation?

00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:27.045
"Dropout Graduation?"

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:28.922
Please come to this event!

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.716
Please come to this event!

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:33.051
Please come to this event!

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.970
Thank you very much!

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.015
A new song!

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:41.268
Don't you think we need a new song
to feature at the event?!

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:43.020
That came out of nowhere.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.772
You already finished passing out the flyers?!

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:50.319
Actually, lots of people from
the neighborhood came by.

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:53.614
We'll help, too, Ino!

00:01:53.614 --> 00:01:54.656
How about we

00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:59.745
use that popularity of yours and
collect a yen from everyone in Japan?

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:01.538
An unexpected evil thought!

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:04.625
The source of all issues is the money, right?!

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:07.878
We need a budget to produce a new song, too!

00:02:07.878 --> 00:02:12.216
B-But the event needs something
special to attract attention!

00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:15.928
Yeah, that's true.

00:02:15.928 --> 00:02:17.846
Then how about we...

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:20.349
...execute our last resort?!

00:02:20.349 --> 00:02:21.683
Oh no!

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:23.560
If only we had the money!

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.355
Sacrifice yourselves, at least!

00:02:26.355 --> 00:02:27.773
Everyone!

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:30.108
I got the vendor list here!

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:31.693
Tone!

00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:36.365
It was a sudden request, but everyone
in the neighborhood's totally in support!

00:02:37.241 --> 00:02:40.244
We were just worrying about
the money, so that's a relief!

00:02:40.244 --> 00:02:43.372
This is the time to make some dough!

00:02:43.372 --> 00:02:46.917
"Monja Love" "Bam!!"
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
I'm also prepared to grill some <i>monja</i>!

00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:49.378
"Monja Love" "Bam!!"
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
What about your pride
for your <i>okonomiyaki </i>joint?

00:02:49.378 --> 00:02:51.421
I overheard a little earlier,

00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:54.174
but by money, were you talking about a new song?

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:59.012
Yes, but there's no time so it's probably
not feasible to get it ready by the event.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:02.558
You can't give up yet, Ino!

00:03:02.558 --> 00:03:05.561
A devilish idea popped into my head just now.

00:03:05.561 --> 00:03:09.439
If all goes well, we'd get our new song
and Roko's popularity will soar!

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:10.524
Seriously?!

00:03:10.524 --> 00:03:13.151
It's a genius idea, if I do say so myself!

00:03:13.151 --> 00:03:15.904
But there is just one problem.

00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:17.197
Problem?

00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:20.242
Roko.

00:03:20.242 --> 00:03:23.745
Will you sacrifice yourself for us?

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:25.497
Could this be...

00:03:25.497 --> 00:03:27.624
...my worst nightmare...?

00:03:39.094 --> 00:03:40.762
Big sister, you're so cute!

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:41.763
Say meow for me!

00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:42.598
Meow...

00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:43.765
One more time!

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:44.641
Meow...

00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:47.352
Your eyes are like a dead fish's;
it gets me excited!

00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:48.562
Even though you're a cat!

00:03:48.562 --> 00:03:50.439
Moving on!

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:52.441
Who's the king?

00:03:52.441 --> 00:03:54.860
Yay! It's me!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.779
What should I do to Roko next?

00:03:57.779 --> 00:04:00.908
Hey, there's something wrong with this!

00:04:00.908 --> 00:04:04.828
I'm not supposed to be the only one
obeying the king in this game!

00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:07.915
So you noticed, huh?

00:04:07.915 --> 00:04:10.876
But you're being sacrificed right now, Roko.

00:04:10.876 --> 00:04:13.879
So you'll never be king, ever.

00:04:13.879 --> 00:04:16.131
What's going to happen to me?!

00:04:16.131 --> 00:04:18.467
This all started with you girls
offering a night with you

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:23.430
in exchange for us providing
a Cream Anmitsu song for the event.

00:04:24.473 --> 00:04:30.145
Plus, can't you fulfill
a younger sister's meager wish

00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:31.939
to spend more time with you?

00:04:31.939 --> 00:04:34.441
Then get rid of those handcuffs right now.

00:04:34.441 --> 00:04:39.071
But I had no idea you felt
so strongly about Mouse House.

00:04:39.071 --> 00:04:40.072
A bit out of character.

00:04:40.072 --> 00:04:40.989
Huh?!

00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:43.450
I-It's not like that at all.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:47.329
It's just that everyone's working hard
and it's kinda fun for me...

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:51.416
That's why I wanted to help out
as a senior in the industry...

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:52.709
Drool...

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:54.628
That's not the reaction I expected.

00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:57.256
It's just that your hot and cold act
is so stereotypical.

00:04:57.256 --> 00:04:58.966
Leave me alone!

00:04:58.966 --> 00:05:02.010
Well, I know where you stand now.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.054
So we'll help you out, too!

00:05:04.054 --> 00:05:05.222
What?

00:05:05.222 --> 00:05:08.225
You'll have a chance to be king now, too!

00:05:08.225 --> 00:05:10.811
You don't get it at all!

00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:13.730
Well, you still have to obey me first.

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:14.815
Give me a hand and bark!

00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:15.816
Bark!

00:05:25.659 --> 00:05:27.286
I did it, girls!

00:05:27.286 --> 00:05:29.621
"Broko"
I finally defeated Chiko and them!

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:31.456
"Broko"
I'm #1, after all!

00:05:31.456 --> 00:05:34.585
"Broko"
Younger sisters are always
inferior to their old sister!

00:05:37.713 --> 00:05:40.132
Stupid-cute...

00:05:40.132 --> 00:05:43.927
What? Cream Anmitsu agreed
to appear at the event?

00:05:43.927 --> 00:05:46.847
That's right! Impressed by
the fruits of my labor?

00:05:46.847 --> 00:05:49.933
I won't be sacrificed and devoured for free.

00:05:49.933 --> 00:05:52.644
Wait, so you were devoured after all?

00:05:52.644 --> 00:05:56.481
So what about the crucial song...?

00:05:56.481 --> 00:05:58.525
All taken care of, of course.

00:05:58.525 --> 00:05:59.818
I've got it right here.

00:05:59.818 --> 00:06:02.529
Blood?! What went down last night?!

00:06:02.529 --> 00:06:04.489
"Cream Anmitsu"

00:06:09.453 --> 00:06:12.915
Hey, it sounds like a pretty cool song.

00:06:12.915 --> 00:06:15.459
Is it a famous song of theirs?

00:06:15.459 --> 00:06:17.419
What?! You don't know it?!

00:06:17.419 --> 00:06:21.006
It's their first song that
ranked #1 in the charts!

00:06:21.006 --> 00:06:22.382
Calm down.

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:24.384
So what is this song called?

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:27.221
It's called "The Demise of Youth
and Little Girl's Wings."

00:06:27.221 --> 00:06:28.472
They're in junior high!

00:06:28.472 --> 00:06:32.726
Since there's not much time,
we've gotta practice!

00:06:32.726 --> 00:06:34.436
We need to learn the choreography, too!

00:06:34.436 --> 00:06:36.855
I've got the DVD!

00:06:36.855 --> 00:06:40.526
Then let's all work hard
for this event, shall we?!

00:06:40.526 --> 00:06:41.777
Yeah!

00:06:41.777 --> 00:06:44.029
"Metropolitan Koganei Park"
"Higako Mouse Festival"

00:06:46.865 --> 00:06:49.409
"Higako Cotton Candy" "Higako Yakisoba!"
"Cotton candy" "Cotton Candy" "Yakisoba"
"2 for 500 yen" "400 yen"

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:51.787
"Delicious!"
"Choco-banana"
"200 yen"
Here you go!

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:56.250
Hey, are you sure it's okay for us to be here?

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.418
Won't we be a bad influence?

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:00.712
Feeling guilty around innocent kids?!

00:07:00.712 --> 00:07:03.799
I didn't expect it to be such a wholesome event!

00:07:03.799 --> 00:07:05.259
I-It's okay!

00:07:05.259 --> 00:07:07.511
Idols are associated with light attributes!

00:07:07.511 --> 00:07:09.137
Light attributes?!

00:07:09.137 --> 00:07:14.184
Idols always rank high in
most-desired careers among girls!

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:16.687
I've heard that, too!

00:07:16.687 --> 00:07:17.729
Me, too!

00:07:17.729 --> 00:07:19.106
Me, too!

00:07:19.106 --> 00:07:21.692
We're safe as long as
little girls look up to us!

00:07:21.692 --> 00:07:24.069
Little girls save the world, you know?!

00:07:24.069 --> 00:07:26.405
Stop saying "little girls" out in public.

00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:27.406
Miss Hoho?!

00:07:27.406 --> 00:07:29.783
All right, it's time to get to work, girls.

00:07:29.783 --> 00:07:31.076
Get ready already!

00:07:31.076 --> 00:07:34.454
What? Don't we have some time
until the concert?

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:35.497
What?

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:38.417
Concert? What are you talking about?

00:07:38.417 --> 00:07:42.337
The main purpose of this event
is to sell off all the leftover merch.

00:07:42.337 --> 00:07:43.755
The first I've heard!

00:07:43.755 --> 00:07:46.049
Cream Anmitsu will be joining us later,

00:07:46.049 --> 00:07:49.636
but it's still a long shot for us
to make it into the NIC finals.

00:07:49.636 --> 00:07:51.430
So that's why!

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.932
This is the only way for us to survive!

00:07:53.932 --> 00:07:55.893
A... A big pot?

00:07:55.893 --> 00:07:56.768
That's right!

00:07:56.768 --> 00:07:58.979
Right now, we're going to make Mouse House's

00:07:58.979 --> 00:08:01.356
special curry and sell it
for 300 yen with merch.

00:08:01.356 --> 00:08:02.941
The merch is a giveaway?!

00:08:02.941 --> 00:08:04.860
Then we'll take those profits,

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.320
and beg for mercy...

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.071
"Superior" "Forgive us!"
Please forgive us!

00:08:08.071 --> 00:08:10.574
"Superior" "Forgive us!"
The reality is a harsh one.

00:08:10.574 --> 00:08:12.576
"Curry" "Curry 300 yen" "Ready soon"

00:08:12.784 --> 00:08:15.746
Anyway, is there even a demand for curry?

00:08:15.746 --> 00:08:19.374
It is just a typical curry, after all.

00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:21.418
Oh, please.

00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:23.629
You don't get it do you, Roko-<i>sempai</i>?

00:08:23.629 --> 00:08:24.588
Huh?

00:08:24.588 --> 00:08:27.549
Think about it! It's prepared by
Roko-<i>sempai </i>and Nina-<i>sempai</i>!

00:08:27.549 --> 00:08:30.093
It's a must-buy no matter what!

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:31.762
To prove it, look!

00:08:32.513 --> 00:08:34.556
People are already lined up for it!

00:08:37.476 --> 00:08:39.394
I'd like ten large bowls, please.

00:08:39.394 --> 00:08:41.021
The usual face!

00:08:44.274 --> 00:08:46.026
We completely sold out.

00:08:46.026 --> 00:08:47.069
We really did...

00:08:47.069 --> 00:08:47.402
"Monja"
We really did...

00:08:47.402 --> 00:08:49.154
"Monja"
Good work, everyone!

00:08:49.154 --> 00:08:51.698
I've brought <i>monja </i>for you all!

00:08:52.616 --> 00:08:54.785
Great... Thanks.

00:08:55.577 --> 00:08:58.789
Anyway, I still can't believe this turnout.

00:08:58.789 --> 00:09:00.832
Considering it was so last minute.

00:09:00.832 --> 00:09:02.751
Well duh!

00:09:02.751 --> 00:09:04.127
I'm not the only Fruit Tart fan.

00:09:04.127 --> 00:09:09.967
The whole neighborhood along with
so many others support you girls.

00:09:09.967 --> 00:09:10.717
What?

00:09:10.717 --> 00:09:11.051
"Confectionery Builddulce"
"Koganei KoCo"
What?

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:14.263
"Confectionery Builddulce"
"Koganei KoCo"
So that's why everyone was happy to participate

00:09:14.263 --> 00:09:18.058
"Confectionery Builddulce"
"Koganei Puffs"
when you all decided to host
an event in our hometown!

00:09:21.353 --> 00:09:24.022
Huh?! Why is everyone crying?

00:09:24.022 --> 00:09:28.235
I almost feel bad about all this support for us.

00:09:28.235 --> 00:09:32.072
This is all thanks to Inocchi
who's loved by our neighbors!

00:09:32.072 --> 00:09:36.285
Oh, where is Ino, by the way?

00:09:39.621 --> 00:09:42.457
Speaking of, I just got a text from her.

00:09:42.457 --> 00:09:44.293
It's an emergency!

00:09:44.293 --> 00:09:46.879
The bathroom line is so long.
My bladder's in trouble...!

00:09:46.879 --> 00:09:48.463
Way to ruin the moment!

00:09:48.463 --> 00:09:50.007
"Bathroom"

00:09:50.215 --> 00:09:54.219
This is bad, it's almost showtime...

00:09:54.219 --> 00:09:58.932
Forget my dignity as an idol,
my dignity as a human is at risk right now...

00:09:58.932 --> 00:10:00.309
--Inocchi!
--Ino-<i>sempai</i>!

00:10:01.518 --> 00:10:02.936
It's going to be all right!

00:10:02.936 --> 00:10:04.855
We're here to rescue you!

00:10:04.855 --> 00:10:07.024
R-Really?!

00:10:07.024 --> 00:10:08.901
"Instant Toilet 2"
--Here.
--What?

00:10:08.901 --> 00:10:10.611
"Instant Toilet 2"
Am I going in the bushes...?

00:10:10.611 --> 00:10:13.780
"We'll be right back."

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.618
I'm still a dignified human,

00:10:17.618 --> 00:10:20.621
but I feel like I lost my dignity as an idol.

00:10:20.621 --> 00:10:22.873
Relax, you didn't have any to begin with.

00:10:22.873 --> 00:10:23.999
"Dismay!!"

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:27.669
Oh, what about you, Hemo? Are you okay?

00:10:27.669 --> 00:10:29.421
It's almost showtime.

00:10:30.839 --> 00:10:33.258
I came prepared today!

00:10:33.258 --> 00:10:37.304
My strategy to wear the tights
I borrowed from you is working!

00:10:38.639 --> 00:10:41.934
I'm glad I was able to help you out, Hemo!

00:10:41.934 --> 00:10:44.478
When did I let her borrow my tights?

00:10:44.478 --> 00:10:46.396
It's about time to be suspicious, Inocchi!

00:10:46.563 --> 00:10:48.357
"Koganei Tourism Town Revitalization Committee"
"Higako Mouse Festival"

00:10:48.357 --> 00:10:50.400
"Koganei Tourism Town Revitalization Committee"
"Higako Mouse Festival"
This is our stage today?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.693
"Koganei Tourism Town Revitalization Committee"
"Higako Mouse Festival"
That's right!

00:10:51.693 --> 00:10:54.780
"Koganei Tourism Town Revitalization Committee"
"Higako Mouse Festival"
I helped out with the set up
too for you, Miss Sakura!

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.782
"Koganei Tourism Town Revitalization Committee"
"Higako Mouse Festival"
Thank you very much!

00:10:56.782 --> 00:10:59.409
The setlist for today is
the main single in the morning

00:10:59.409 --> 00:11:02.579
and the Cream Anmitsu song
in the afternoon, was that right?

00:11:02.579 --> 00:11:03.664
Yeah.

00:11:03.664 --> 00:11:06.291
But there's been a change
in the morning program.

00:11:06.291 --> 00:11:09.127
There's a song I want you all to sing.

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:11.338
A song you want us to sing?

00:11:11.338 --> 00:11:13.423
A Higako song or something?

00:11:13.423 --> 00:11:14.716
Here are the props.

00:11:14.716 --> 00:11:17.511
Are you picking a fight here?

00:11:17.511 --> 00:11:18.971
It's already been decided.

00:11:18.971 --> 00:11:20.305
Quit whining.

00:11:20.305 --> 00:11:23.475
There's no way I'm singing "Broko's Song"!

00:11:23.475 --> 00:11:28.021
Besides, don't the rights to the song
belong to my previous agency?

00:11:28.021 --> 00:11:31.316
Yeah! But when I called them last week...

00:11:31.316 --> 00:11:32.526
Do what you want.

00:11:32.526 --> 00:11:33.360
Really?!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.611
They didn't care at all.

00:11:34.611 --> 00:11:36.613
Darn agency!

00:11:36.613 --> 00:11:38.156
And look over there!

00:11:38.156 --> 00:11:38.574
"I Love Broko"
And look over there!

00:11:38.574 --> 00:11:41.743
"I Love Broko"
We've already set up everything for you!

00:11:41.743 --> 00:11:43.662
"I Love Broko"
Doesn't Broko take you back?

00:11:43.662 --> 00:11:46.498
"I Love Broko"
She was so popular when we were kids!

00:11:47.499 --> 00:11:51.336
So tell me, do you really think
you can betray them?

00:11:52.379 --> 00:11:55.966
B-But I'm 17 years old now.

00:11:55.966 --> 00:11:58.510
I'd just be everyone's laughingstock.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.972
It's all right, Roko.

00:12:01.972 --> 00:12:06.393
You can show them how you've
grown to be a young lady!

00:12:06.393 --> 00:12:10.063
I'm sure everyone's
looking forward to seeing you.

00:12:10.063 --> 00:12:12.149
R-Really?

00:12:13.442 --> 00:12:14.943
"I Love Broko"

00:12:14.943 --> 00:12:16.820
"I Love Broko"
Broko!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.655
"I Love Broko"
Look over here!

00:12:25.913 --> 00:12:27.581
--Broko!
--So cute!

00:12:27.581 --> 00:12:28.874
She's so tiny!

00:12:28.874 --> 00:12:31.251
She hasn't changed at all!

00:12:31.251 --> 00:12:33.879
Maybe she's Broko's little sister in elementary?

00:12:33.879 --> 00:12:36.715
She did mention she has a little sister!

00:12:36.715 --> 00:12:39.927
Right? There's no way
she hasn't changed one bit!

00:12:39.927 --> 00:12:42.429
You've got this, Broko's little sister!

00:12:44.139 --> 00:12:45.933
Roko-<i>sempai</i>?!

00:12:45.933 --> 00:12:50.312
The delicious broccoli
was enjoyed by Ino and the girls.

00:12:50.312 --> 00:12:51.188
I'm Oto Kogane.

00:12:51.188 --> 00:12:53.023
I'm the 19-year-old acting
president of Cat Productions.

00:12:53.023 --> 00:12:55.192
My birthday is February 2nd and blood type is A.

00:12:55.192 --> 00:12:57.694
I'm 141 cm tall and weigh 34 kg!

00:12:57.694 --> 00:13:00.072
My favorite thing is elementary school students!

00:13:07.496 --> 00:13:09.498
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:13:18.841 --> 00:13:22.511
Why are we in maid costumes
for the afternoon half?

00:13:22.511 --> 00:13:24.763
I mean, it's very cute...

00:13:24.763 --> 00:13:28.892
That's because I was able to
snatch them from Chiko and them.

00:13:28.892 --> 00:13:33.730
Besides... the only other costume
they had were smocks...

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:37.067
What happened to Roko-<i>sempai </i>that night?!

00:13:37.067 --> 00:13:40.362
Hey, but what about these cat ears?

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:41.488
And the tails...

00:13:41.488 --> 00:13:44.157
Shouldn't we be representing "rats"?

00:13:45.158 --> 00:13:46.535
This is why...

00:13:46.535 --> 00:13:48.287
...I've brought these just in case!

00:13:48.287 --> 00:13:50.330
It's censored!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.667
Let's just go without the ears.

00:13:53.667 --> 00:13:54.835
It seems too risky.

00:13:54.835 --> 00:13:56.336
--Agreed.
--What?!

00:13:56.336 --> 00:13:57.880
But these are mouse ears!

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:01.592
Mice dominate the world
with animation and games!

00:14:01.592 --> 00:14:04.344
Just drop that reference already!

00:14:04.344 --> 00:14:08.932
Besides, mouse ears remind me of
that creepy Broko mascot and I hate it!

00:14:08.932 --> 00:14:10.726
What?!

00:14:10.726 --> 00:14:14.396
Weren't you going for the
mouse look with that hairstyle?

00:14:14.396 --> 00:14:17.149
She's finally brought up the subject
everyone's been avoiding?!

00:14:17.149 --> 00:14:18.817
Y-You're wrong!

00:14:18.817 --> 00:14:22.112
There's a profound reason behind these buns!

00:14:22.112 --> 00:14:23.906
A reason?

00:14:26.742 --> 00:14:28.952
See? Now do you get it?

00:14:28.952 --> 00:14:29.870
Huh?

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:30.162
"After" "Before"
"1.5 times more!!"
Huh?

00:14:30.162 --> 00:14:34.124
"After" "Before"
"1.5 times more!!"
The area I take up is completely
different without the buns, right?

00:14:34.124 --> 00:14:36.084
"After" "Before"
"1.5 times more!!"
It's about the area?!

00:14:36.084 --> 00:14:40.005
Chiko wanted to copy me and
it was a problem when we were kids.

00:14:40.005 --> 00:14:42.925
--You can't copy me, Chiko!
--Oh...

00:14:42.925 --> 00:14:45.719
Chiko had a reason behind her hairstyle, too!

00:14:45.719 --> 00:14:51.266
Anyway, I'm not the only one who's
concerned with the area they take up.

00:14:51.266 --> 00:14:52.935
Why are you looking at us?!

00:14:52.935 --> 00:14:55.854
I'm 10 cm taller than you, Roko!

00:14:55.854 --> 00:14:58.065
I'm also 5 cm taller!

00:14:58.899 --> 00:15:01.485
10 cm...? 5 cm...?

00:15:03.529 --> 00:15:07.324
That's right! I set my profile
to say I'm 140 cm!

00:15:07.324 --> 00:15:10.494
Is your idol profile full of lies?

00:15:12.621 --> 00:15:16.375
Nina, don't you have a reason
behind your hairstyle, too?!

00:15:16.375 --> 00:15:21.630
Oh come on! I was trying really hard
not to be involved in this topic!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.925
It's just that... short hair
is easier to manage.

00:15:24.925 --> 00:15:28.637
If it's long, I think it'll attract unnecessary
attention below my shoulders...

00:15:28.637 --> 00:15:29.847
Attention?

00:15:33.392 --> 00:15:37.479
Wow! Your boobs sure are the best, Nina!

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:41.525
Don't force the attention!

00:15:42.568 --> 00:15:44.987
Girls! This is bad!

00:15:44.987 --> 00:15:47.656
The speakers are in dire shape!

00:15:51.451 --> 00:15:55.414
O-Oh no. Are these speakers broken now?

00:15:55.414 --> 00:15:56.498
That's right...

00:15:56.498 --> 00:15:59.835
The main speakers broke out of nowhere.

00:15:59.835 --> 00:16:02.254
We need to do something, or else...

00:16:02.254 --> 00:16:03.130
Huh?!

00:16:05.382 --> 00:16:08.051
That's not the reaction I expected!

00:16:08.051 --> 00:16:09.428
Sorry.

00:16:09.428 --> 00:16:13.515
I just got excited about this
TV drama-like cliche turn of events.

00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:15.976
Face the reality!

00:16:15.976 --> 00:16:17.561
You're right...

00:16:17.561 --> 00:16:21.356
We're not worthy of being stars
or background characters...

00:16:21.356 --> 00:16:23.942
That's not the reality I was talking about.

00:16:23.942 --> 00:16:26.069
Hey, could this be because...

00:16:26.069 --> 00:16:28.780
...we broke it with our dancing...?

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.657
All that running around?

00:16:30.657 --> 00:16:32.826
I don't think that would do it...

00:16:32.826 --> 00:16:36.872
But I did find a strange green
plant-looking thing behind the stage.

00:16:36.872 --> 00:16:39.499
It's quite the mystery.

00:16:42.503 --> 00:16:45.422
We left some behind?!

00:16:45.422 --> 00:16:47.549
Do you know of something?

00:16:47.549 --> 00:16:48.759
What?

00:16:48.759 --> 00:16:50.385
You can't hide anything.

00:16:50.385 --> 00:16:51.470
Yikes.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:55.849
You can't fool the eyes of the
draw girl of an <i>okonomiyaki </i>joint!

00:16:57.017 --> 00:17:01.772
Would speakers break if I
threw down broccoli on the ground?!

00:17:01.772 --> 00:17:04.775
What? They wouldn't break
just because of that...

00:17:04.775 --> 00:17:07.945
They're a bit old, so it might've been its time.

00:17:07.945 --> 00:17:11.073
But I'm not sure why
there's liquid coming out of it...

00:17:13.742 --> 00:17:15.702
There's a plastic bottle here...

00:17:15.702 --> 00:17:16.954
"Hoho's" "Brown"

00:17:18.539 --> 00:17:19.748
"Brown"

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.628
I'm terribly sorry!

00:17:24.628 --> 00:17:26.964
Don't worry about it. It's old equipment.

00:17:27.923 --> 00:17:30.008
That cost me a month's worth of my salary...

00:17:30.008 --> 00:17:31.468
What did you expect?

00:17:31.468 --> 00:17:33.428
But what should we do?

00:17:33.428 --> 00:17:37.558
The show won't be the same
without the main speakers...

00:17:38.517 --> 00:17:40.978
I think Hoho better go buy them now.

00:17:40.978 --> 00:17:42.771
What a drag...

00:17:43.689 --> 00:17:45.440
Seems like you're all in a bind.

00:17:47.109 --> 00:17:47.568
"Oto"

00:17:47.568 --> 00:17:48.652
"Rua" "Nua"
"Oto"

00:17:48.652 --> 00:17:50.320
"Rua" "Nua"
"Oto"
Hey, big sister!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.489
"Rua" "Nua"
"Oto"
We're here!

00:17:52.489 --> 00:17:54.533
Cat Productions'...

00:17:54.533 --> 00:17:55.701
...perverts...

00:17:55.701 --> 00:17:57.703
That was unnecessary!

00:17:57.703 --> 00:17:57.995
"Riri" "Oto"
That was unnecessary!

00:17:57.995 --> 00:18:00.873
"Riri" "Oto"
We rushed over after work,

00:18:00.873 --> 00:18:03.125
"Riri" "Oto"
so you better watch that mouth.

00:18:03.125 --> 00:18:04.710
"Riri" "Oto"
Hey there!

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:07.212
"Riri" "Oto"
Why are they in school swimsuits?!

00:18:07.212 --> 00:18:09.464
I heard a little about your situation.

00:18:09.464 --> 00:18:13.010
And we decided to help you girls out
as a major agency.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.052
Seriously?!

00:18:14.052 --> 00:18:15.012
Yup.

00:18:15.012 --> 00:18:17.306
But under one condition.

00:18:19.516 --> 00:18:22.561
You can't take off those precious cat ears.

00:18:22.561 --> 00:18:25.564
"Roaring"

00:18:26.231 --> 00:18:29.985
Are they scheming to take over our concert?!

00:18:33.655 --> 00:18:36.116
Wow! Good job, major agency!

00:18:37.159 --> 00:18:39.953
Go ahead, you can carry them
to the stage now, Miss.

00:18:39.953 --> 00:18:40.871
Huh?!

00:18:40.871 --> 00:18:41.830
What?

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:44.875
We didn't bring any of our stage crew,
so what do you expect?

00:18:45.751 --> 00:18:47.211
Darn you, major agency!

00:18:48.921 --> 00:18:49.755
It's heavy...

00:18:49.755 --> 00:18:51.381
Even for you, Inocchi?!

00:18:51.381 --> 00:18:54.635
Oh my, that's quite a bit of equipment there.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.178
"Okonomiyaki Tone"

00:18:56.178 --> 00:18:57.971
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
Tone's mother!

00:18:57.971 --> 00:18:59.848
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
And our neighbors!

00:18:59.848 --> 00:19:02.518
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
It'd be difficult to carry
all that with just you girls.

00:19:02.518 --> 00:19:07.022
"Okonomiyaki Tone"
What do you say?
Will you let us help you all out?

00:19:07.022 --> 00:19:08.565
But it's very heavy equipment!

00:19:08.565 --> 00:19:10.359
Don't worry about it.

00:19:10.359 --> 00:19:13.320
We've got the neighborhood spirit, you know?

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:15.614
This has been a fun event!

00:19:15.614 --> 00:19:18.200
Let us help until the end.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.495
You're all so kind
when this was all our fault...

00:19:21.495 --> 00:19:25.082
Oh, Fruit Tart. We're all so grateful for you.

00:19:25.082 --> 00:19:28.252
That you all thought of our neighborhood.

00:19:28.252 --> 00:19:31.922
Remember that we all love you, Fruit Tart!

00:19:33.006 --> 00:19:36.593
So we're all excited for
your concert after this, too!

00:19:36.593 --> 00:19:37.761
Good luck!

00:19:37.761 --> 00:19:39.179
We're rooting for you!

00:19:39.179 --> 00:19:42.266
I can't wait for your performance!

00:19:42.266 --> 00:19:44.309
E-Everyone!

00:19:44.309 --> 00:19:46.562
Yes! We'll do our best!

00:19:52.067 --> 00:19:56.029
Thank you for today, everyone!

00:19:56.029 --> 00:20:02.286
This event couldn't have happened
without any of you!

00:20:02.286 --> 00:20:08.166
Our usual dropout selves
felt a little like heroines today!

00:20:08.166 --> 00:20:11.712
Even if we don't make it to
the National Idol Championships finals,

00:20:11.712 --> 00:20:14.756
and Fruit Tart breaks up...

00:20:14.756 --> 00:20:18.302
...we were dropouts to begin with!

00:20:18.302 --> 00:20:22.848
We'll continue to challenge ourselves
and start all over again!

00:20:22.848 --> 00:20:24.224
Seriously?!

00:20:24.224 --> 00:20:24.558
"Higako"
Seriously?!

00:20:24.558 --> 00:20:26.977
"Higako"
Now I hope you all enjoy this song!

00:20:26.977 --> 00:20:31.481
Cream Anmitsu's "The Demise of Youth
and Little Girl's Wings"!

00:21:01.637 --> 00:21:03.263
Amazing...

00:21:03.263 --> 00:21:05.807
You're all really amazing, girls!

00:21:05.807 --> 00:21:09.937
It's a Cream Anmitsu song,
but it sounds like Fruit Tart!

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:13.524
You're right.

00:21:13.524 --> 00:21:17.319
They've finally established themselves
as a unique idol group.

00:21:17.319 --> 00:21:19.655
Even though they're dummies individually.

00:21:19.655 --> 00:21:22.824
What's crucial is whether their uniqueness

00:21:22.824 --> 00:21:25.244
translates into profit!

00:21:25.244 --> 00:21:26.870
S-So cool...

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:30.582
She says such disheartening things
when she doesn't read the air.

00:21:31.667 --> 00:21:33.919
Well, but it's true.

00:21:33.919 --> 00:21:36.129
As they said earlier,

00:21:36.129 --> 00:21:39.299
we're still very much dropouts.

00:21:39.299 --> 00:21:42.386
But as long as we don't give up,

00:21:42.386 --> 00:21:46.515
we may achieve big dreams someday.

00:21:46.515 --> 00:21:49.601
Not that I have high hopes or anything.

00:21:49.601 --> 00:21:54.231
But I'll say there's five drops of hope
that spilled out of despair.

00:22:23.677 --> 00:22:25.846
"National Idol Championships!"
"Results!"

00:22:25.846 --> 00:22:27.347
"National Idol Championships!"
"Fruit Tart"
"Proceeding to Finals!!"

00:22:29.933 --> 00:22:32.644
We did it!

00:22:32.644 --> 00:22:35.856
Cream Anmitsu's support was effective!

00:22:35.856 --> 00:22:38.650
Chiko actually helped us out!

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:42.529
Cream Anmitsu's dance skills
were on another level!

00:22:42.529 --> 00:22:44.990
We barely kept up with them!

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:47.367
They were great at singing, too!

00:22:47.367 --> 00:22:51.872
Jeez, you girls need more
confidence in yourselves.

00:22:51.872 --> 00:22:56.793
I doubt we would make it
with our popularity alone.

00:22:56.793 --> 00:23:01.340
It would be difficult even with
our neighbors' support.

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:03.884
So what ended up being the deciding factor?

00:23:03.884 --> 00:23:06.303
Oh, actually, it was this.

00:23:08.472 --> 00:23:12.100
You all didn't notice your skirts
flipped up during the concert, huh?

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.852
I never knew about this!

00:23:13.852 --> 00:23:18.232
There was a huge debate
whether this was intentional or not.

00:23:21.443 --> 00:23:22.861
It kinda went viral.

00:23:22.861 --> 00:23:24.154
Viral?!

00:23:28.158 --> 00:23:29.660
"Metropolitan Koganei Park"

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:32.538
"Metropolitan Koganei Park"
In any case, I'm glad we bought
the underwear for show.

00:23:32.538 --> 00:23:34.206
In any case, I'm glad we bought
the underwear for show.

00:23:34.206 --> 00:23:38.168
Although the fate of Mouse House
is still on the line,

00:23:38.168 --> 00:23:40.546
I'd like to continue doing my best

00:23:40.546 --> 00:23:44.341
along with everyone of Fruit Tart!

00:23:44.341 --> 00:23:50.144
Let's continue this story again some other time!
